        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Task Force White Eagle, 1st Cavalry Division, United States Army, U.S. military, NVA, Viet Cong\n- Events: Operation Thayer\n- Places: Binh Dinh\n- Concepts: combined arms division, military command\n\nFacts:\n- Operation Thayer was carried out primarily by the United States 1st Cavalry Division against NVA and Viet Cong regiments believed to be in Binh Dinh.\n- The 1st Cavalry Division, also called \"First Team,\" is a combined arms division.\n- The 1st Cavalry Division is one of the most decorated combat divisions of the United States Army and of the U.S. military.\n- Task Force White Eagle is under the command of the U.S. 1st Cavalry Division.",
